  "interpretation": "During two EGO input-timeout clusters, the independent camera-pose reader continued to receive nondecreasing source stamps with maximum 66 ms stamp gaps. This weakens a publisher-wide camera-pose outage explanation. It does not prove delivery to EGO’s own reader, and does not distinguish EGO pose-reader behavior from depth delivery or message_filters pairing. Both clusters preceded the localization normalized-cost gate closure. The cause remains unresolved.",
